Description:It is your first main phase. You control Strionic Resonator and have Duplicant and Fling in hand, with ten red mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls Canyon Minotaur and Grizzly Bears. End the turn with both of the opponent's creatures in exile and the opponent at 0 life or less.
Rule:rulesguru-0b1c6e43049db59a | A copied triggered ability resolves before the original (CR 405.2, 707.10), and Duplicant takes the power and toughness of the last creature card exiled with it: copy Duplicant's imprint trigger with Strionic Resonator, aim the copy at Grizzly Bears and the original at Canyon Minotaur, so Duplicant is 3/3 and Fling deals 3
